	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas cum <placeName>Soloduri</placeName> essem accepi et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>misisti, que mihi pro charissimo munere est, et gratias <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>maximas ago.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Novi nihil habeo, nisi que videtis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>certa ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>, que viderentur reginę secunda, sed <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>non est spes, quod unquam principem <placeName ref="l875">Hispanum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>intromissuri sint.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominis dominis scribo propter <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nonnullos nebulones... qui sub nomine regis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Romani volunt vestrum militem abducere vel potius <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>introducere ad seditiones movendas; sunt artes <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Cesarum et domini <persName>Ferrandi</persName> et ducis <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudie</placeName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>libenter amicitiam nostram et pacem vestram <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>publicam interturbarent.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In hoc toti sunt; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hac enim via existimant se posse regi maxime et <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vobis nocere, quod deus avertat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Expecto <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quotidie aliquid a <persName ref="p3375">Vergerio</persName>, et mirum, quod <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nihil scribit, cum undique ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> veniun<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>t litere de federe principum, quod <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>iam asserunt regem Romanum sequi; sed... <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>inter fratres... certo expectatur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/><persName>Princeps Hispanus</persName> comparat vires ad <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>invisendum patrem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Apud nos omnia <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>prospera, sic in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Deus tua fortunet.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Si queras, quid hic agam, ut etiam domini <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tui non ignorare possint, ago cum quodam <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>marchionis depputato pro redemptione domini <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ducis <persName>Daumalle</persName> qui frater est domini <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>de <persName>Guyse</persName> (quem iste marquis per proditionem anno <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>preterito, cum a nobis prope <placeName ref="l322">Metenses</placeName> ad Caesarem <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>deficeret, intercepit et ab illo tempore <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l2510">Turcice</placeName> tractavit).</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale bene.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l21">Baddeni</placeName> 5a mart<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tuus sem<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>per <persName ref="p8296">Bassafont<pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>aneus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Optimo viro et amico <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Bulingero</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
